[{"id":"CN-HTTP-011","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","代理","502","504"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>遇到 502 或 504，如何区别网关和上游问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先确认错误响应由哪个网关产生，再沿客户端到网关、网关到上游、上游内部的时间线检查 DNS、TCP、TLS、响应格式和超时。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>502 通常表示网关从上游得到无效响应，504 表示等待上游超时；状态码不能替代网关日志和上游证据，也不能直接指向某一段代码。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-route-actions","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["网络Mock","Route"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>需要模拟推荐接口断网时，应使用哪种路由动作？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>abort()\u003c/code> 注入网络失败；\u003ccode>fulfill()\u003c/code> 返回模拟响应；\u003ccode>continue_()\u003c/code> 修改后继续发送真实请求。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>continue_()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fulfill()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>abort()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-download-lifecycle","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["下载","生命周期"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(六)常见组件操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(六)常见组件操作","articlePath":"posts/8df5b6f3/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(六)常见组件操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(六)常见组件操作","articlePath":"posts/8df5b6f3/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>expect_download()\u003c/code> 返回 Download 对象后，还要验证哪些边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先判断 \u003ccode>failure()\u003c/code>，再按运行环境选择 \u003ccode>path()\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>save_as()\u003c/code>，并在 Context 关闭前完成读取或保存。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>下载事件只证明对象已产生；临时路径受生命周期和远程连接影响，保存到受控目录比长期依赖临时路径更稳定。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-execution-phases","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["执行模型"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型","articlePath":"posts/9d696b94/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型","articlePath":"posts/9d696b94/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一次 Pytest 运行包含哪些阶段，失败阶段会怎样影响结果？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>按启动、收集、setup、call、teardown、报告和退出码理解；setup 失败不会进入 call，teardown 失败会追加清理错误。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先确认是否收集到目标 Node ID，再判断失败发生在 Fixture 建立、测试调用还是资源清理。\u003ccode>failed\u003c/code> 通常表示断言不符，\u003ccode>error\u003c/code> 表示流程异常；两者都应结合回溯和退出码处理，不能只看终端颜色。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-runtime-thread-process-async","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","threading","multiprocessing","asyncio"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>线程、进程和 asyncio 如何按任务选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>阻塞 I/O 常用线程，CPU 密集且可序列化的任务常用进程，大量可等待 I/O 且链路可 async 时用 asyncio。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>线程共享内存，进程隔离且有序列化成本，协程在一个线程内协作调度。先测量瓶颈和依赖库，再选择最小复杂度的方案。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]